5	//  Implements BDKW Eq.(3.10): basic tree amplitude for
6	//  q-(p4)+Q(-p2)+l-(-p5) --> q+(p1)+Q-(p3)+l+(p6)
7	//  All outgoing particles are right-handed, except Q(p3) which is left-handed.
8	//  Note: all tree amplitudes are divided by i relative to the BDKW paper.
